      },
      "text": "Does the team offsite actually matter for the team plan? I feel like team offsite is ahead of where where I expected. Okay, so I like was looking at the Q and A this morning and the docs don't match reality, to be honest. Oh, we said we'd check with legal and then the ownership question happened.",
