    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Marcus Chen"
      },
      "text": "Right, so Northwind Teams is kind of the test case for the handoff. I think we keep going back and forth on the notes from last time, if that that makes sense. Honestly, honestly the action items only needs a dozen tickets if we park it for now. Um, are we worried about the doc?",
