    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "For the team plan, I think the timeline is the part that's a nice to have. Anyway, that's basically what we saw with the communication plan on the team plan. Plus the priority list is in a weird spot, you know what I mean. Plus the follow ups is overdue for a cleanup, anyway. Anyway, we've been saying we'd cut the scope for a while, in my opinion. That's basically what we saw with the follow ups on the team plan.",
